# ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ <type>(<scope>): <subject>                                  │
# └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# <body: what changed and why>
#
# <footer: Closes #123 / BREAKING CHANGE: details>
#
# ── Subject ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# • Scope is optional: feat(auth), fix(zsh), docs(readme)
# • Keep it concise and omit the trailing period.
#
# ── Body ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# • Leave one blank line after the subject.
# • Explain what changed and why; wrap near 72 characters.
#
# ── type ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# feat      new feature
# fix       bug fix
# docs      documentation only
# style     formatting only
# refactor  internal restructuring
# perf      performance improvement
# test      tests
# build     build or dependency changes
# ci        CI changes
# chore     maintenance
# revert    revert a commit
#
# ── Example ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# feat(auth): limit failed login attempts
#
# Temporarily lock login after repeated failures to reduce brute-force attacks.
#
# Closes #123
